{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_03_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d16fd07c45f3250a779fa1c07845eb79a27c06491e4fb222e41e1312c0fcfb5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c35cbab0c6ab8533ae2de874a69739211aa0160a60bcc635425af9e1162df55",
      "text": "呼啊啊～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b92570180c0ee66407f39db1e19144d094be2e534036c18fab1b2b6332eff01",
      "text": "隼人，好大一个哈欠……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad0350f645e84d82e51a910b9876e021899d0c986149f280c749a07af5f2b55",
      "text": "写歌有点卡壳了。都没怎么\n合眼。哥哥还骂我“赶紧去睡觉”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84bc88bc6bd964915998d0856c70f830d0b38a7961f7222049fc7cbfba2377ba",
      "text": "作曲，看起来好辛苦……\n要是有能做的事……我，来帮忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a1ed0dbfc470e0c329418d87000595b51d418635e00682e15bc412f8e7610b1",
      "text": "谢谢！有什么事我会找你的！\n话说春名呢？好像还没来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885ab7ce37a0c1fc0ecf4b7bb844a6018135647828cfc20c418b1d57e5007147",
      "text": "春名亲因为打工所以社团活动请假了！\n……呃，x和y……x是3？为什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ced2457b3cb974481176911abe9c206eebc11e95469b23f05194b6fa8869943",
      "text": "这样啊。\n……等等，四季，你在学习吗？真稀奇啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0b7b43822b6b18d8216cb6d5743ee7e1fd95ec93a7f8d5afe9bff5c2255783",
      "text": "之前逃掉的小测验要补考啦！\n所以，现在正让旬亲给我补习数学呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc75bce04b1abbf903ab45c4035f00ccc8552e298d79e4ede33265cd01d1a876",
      "text": "这次补考要是不及格，四季君就得被禁止参加社团活动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50079ce31427b0816c78d73cf4fd5acf36dd1e2da0b632ad20021a2bbb677c3b",
      "text": "怎么这样！旬亲太严格了啦！\n呃，如果x是3的话……y是10？为什么啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:770e2e0652ddd4a2bd794424748ab4b5cf60a22eb1b9789852c6e8ad2004234f",
      "text": "刚才不是解释过了吗……\n在x=3的情况下，y是……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
